Package: quickPlot
Type: Package
Title: Minimal 'quickPlot' Stand-in for NetLogoR in webR
Version: 1.0.4.9001
Description: NetLogoR imports a handful of generics and one class from
    'quickPlot', which in turn pulls in 'ggplot2', 'terra' and their
    dependencies. Fashion Market draws on an HTML canvas instead, so
    this package defines only those generics and the class, with the same
    signatures as 'quickPlot' 1.0.4, and no plotting.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: methods
Encoding: UTF-8
